      <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 800; font-family: var(--font-tech);">Our Mission & Vision</h2>
      
      <p><strong>bhuj.kutchonline.com</strong> was founded with a simple idea: people should be able to find the services they need in their own city without confusion or endless searching. Bhuj is home to an incredible variety of trades, shops, and professionals, yet much of that information stays offline or spread through word of mouth. We want to change that.</p>

      <p>By organizing and showcasing local services in one easy-to-use platform, <strong>bhuj.kutchonline.com</strong> helps residents make informed choices and supports the growth of local businesses. When small enterprises thrive, the whole city benefits.</p>

      <p>Our mission is to make Bhuj more connected and efficient while celebrating its entrepreneurial spirit. We’re committed to adding more categories, improving accuracy, and building tools that help users and businesses interact better.</p>

      <p style="font-weight: 600; margin-top: 24px; color: #2563eb; font-family: var(--font-tech); text-transform: lowercase;">bhuj.kutchonline.com is more than a directory. It’s a step toward a stronger, smarter Bhuj.</p>
